# Raw per-run JSONL caches (translations/judgments) grow unbounded run over
# run and routinely exceed GitHub's 50MB recommended file size — LFS keeps
# them out of the main git object store.
# docs/results/*.json is deliberately EXCLUDED: GitHub Pages serves it
# directly to the dashboard's fetch() calls, and Pages does not resolve LFS
# pointers, so putting it in LFS would break the live site.
results/**/*.jsonl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
